    "title": "Tacos La Bala to Open its Next Eatery in New Caney - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Candese Charles ,\n6 hours ago Tacos La Bala is on the move! The popular family-owned Mexican restaurant chain is expanding. According to a recently filed Texas Department of Licensing and Regulation permit, the new Tacos La Bala is set to open in New Caney in Montgomery County, within the Caney Crossing shopping center at 20460 FM 1485 suite A. Read full article",
